      "extract": "AN EXPERIMENTAL INVESTIGATION OF NEUMANN’S CONJECTURE STEPHEN GILLES AND PETER HUSTON Abstract. We use a large census of hyperbolic 3-manifolds to experimentally investigate a conjecture of Neumann regarding the Bloch Group. We present an augmented census including, for feasible invariant trace ﬁelds, explicit man- ifolds (associated to that ﬁeld) that appear to generate the Bloch group of that ﬁeld. We also make",
