      "extract": "Our primary result, described in section~\\ref{sec:main-result}, is a large census of hyperbolic 3-manifolds, organized by invariant trace field, together with tables expressing volumes as linear combinations of other manifolds' volumes. This census is available at \\url{http://www.curve.unhyperbolic.org/linComb}. Examining this census has allowed us, in many cases, to explicitly list manifolds which give rise to",
