      "extract": "\\label{subsec:bloch-group} \\begin{definition} For any field $F$, the \\definedterm{Pre-Bloch group on $F$}, denoted $\\prebloch{F}$, is defined as \\[ \\prebloch{F} = \\frac{\\langle \\set{z \\in F \\given z \\ne 0_F, 1_F} \\rangle}{[z_1] - [z_2] + \\left[\\frac{z_2}{z_1}\\right] - \\left[\\frac{1 - z_2}{1 - z_1}\\right] + \\left[ \\frac{1 - z_2^{-1}}{1 - z_1^{-1}}\\right]}. \\] \\end{definition} The relation in the denominator is known",
